1
00:00:10,042 --> 00:00:11,599
Book, are you in your room?

2
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:12,966
Yes, Mom. I'm here.

3
00:00:12,966 --> 00:00:15,338
I talked to your teacher.
Do you know what she said?

4
00:00:15,338 --> 00:00:21,474
If your scores stay like this,
they might send someone else to compete in the Olympiad.

5
00:00:21,474 --> 00:00:24,125
There are other students performing
better than you now.

6
00:00:24,514 --> 00:00:26,753
What's going on, Book?

7
00:00:26,753 --> 00:00:31,474
Nothing, Mom.
The lessons just got harder, that's all.

8
00:00:31,474 --> 00:00:35,364
If it's hard, what should you do?
You need to focus, right?

9
00:00:35,364 --> 00:00:40,640
Hold on— Mom has to take this call.
I'll call you back.

10
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:05,663
Frame— did you see this?

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,000
(Leaked video from a famous all-boys school)

12
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:13,814
So… don't you wanna try?
Just a little?

13
00:01:13,814 --> 00:01:15,985
No, Frame. Not now.

14
00:01:15,985 --> 00:01:19,327
Sorry, Book—
but I'm kinda worked up right now.

15
00:01:21,186 --> 00:01:25,146
Book, I'm out of soap.

16
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:31,473
Book?
What's wrong with you?

17
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,462
Frame… this is bad.

18
00:01:49,159 --> 00:01:52,123
What do I do? Frame,
I'm scared.
